    "detailed_description": "\u3010RPG Tool\u3011 RPG Maker MZ<br />\r\n\u3010Genre\u3011 Huxla Command RPG<br />\r\n\u3010Play time\u301120\u301c100 hours or more<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver 50,000 downloads in total!<br />\r\nThe latest in Chameleon's flagship &quot;Huxla Dungeon&quot; series is now available for the first time in 3 years!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCharacter make-up (more than 500 face glamour) + Occupation selection (20 occupations)<br />\r\nEnchantment synthesis<br />\r\nSub-events<br />\r\nA New Game with a Little Strength<br />\r\nCollectors will love the Armor Book and more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor Huxla lovers<br />\r\nWe aimed to create a game that would make people say, &quot;This is just the kind of game I want to play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe have also included a &quot;tutorial&quot; in this game to help newcomers to the Huxla world.<br />\r\nWe hope that beginners of Huxla will also pick up this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you enjoy the game as much as we do!",
    "about_the_game": "\u3010RPG Tool\u3011 RPG Maker MZ<br />\r\n\u3010Genre\u3011 Huxla Command RPG<br />\r\n\u3010Play time\u301120\u301c100 hours or more<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver 50,000 downloads in total!<br />\r\nThe latest in Chameleon's flagship &quot;Huxla Dungeon&quot; series is now available for the first time in 3 years!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCharacter make-up (more than 500 face glamour) + Occupation selection (20 occupations)<br />\r\nEnchantment synthesis<br />\r\nSub-events<br />\r\nA New Game with a Little Strength<br />\r\nCollectors will love the Armor Book and more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor Huxla lovers<br />\r\nWe aimed to create a game that would make people say, &quot;This is just the kind of game I want to play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe have also included a &quot;tutorial&quot; in this game to help newcomers to the Huxla world.<br />\r\nWe hope that beginners of Huxla will also pick up this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you enjoy the game as much as we do!",
    "short_description": "\u3010Genre\u3011 Huxla RPG Character make-up (more than 500 face glamour) + Occupation selection (20 occupations) Enchantment synthesis Sub-event Collectors will love the Armor Book and more! Huxla lovers will love the many features throughout the game! Create your own party and enjoy the Huxla experience!",
